@startuml FinancialManagement_Pengurus_Seq

title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Keuangan (Pengurus)

actor Pengurus
participant "Dashboard" as Dashboard
participant System
database Database

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Buka halaman keuangan
Dashboard -> Database: Query income + expense
Database --> Dashboard: Return transactions
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan dashboard

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Input transaksi baru
Pengurus -> Dashboard: Isi form (judul, nominal, kategori)
Dashboard -> System: Validate form
System --> Dashboard: Valid / Invalid

alt Form valid
  System -> Database: Create transaction (status=pending)
  System -> System: Send notification to admin
  Database --> System: Success
  System --> Dashboard: Show success message
else Form invalid
  System --> Dashboard: Show error message
end

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Filter transactions
Dashboard -> Database: Query transactions dengan filter
Database --> Dashboard: Return filtered list
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan filtered transactions

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Klik transaksi untuk detail
Dashboard -> Database: Query transaction detail
Database --> Dashboard: Return detail + bukti
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan detail

alt Status = Approved
  Dashboard --> Pengurus: Show "Approved by admin"
else Status = Rejected
  Dashboard --> Pengurus: Show alasan reject + option edit
else Status = Pending
  Dashboard --> Pengurus: Show "Waiting approval"
end

Pengurus -> Dashboard: Lihat laporan keuangan
Dashboard -> Database: Aggregate transactions (approved only)
Database --> Dashboard: Return summary data
Dashboard --> Pengurus: Tampilkan charts & reports

@enduml
